From 826b8de9515f7ed50b28f374b196df9b367a251b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qr0n <77075118+qr0n@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:23:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] p100: STRATA_GU_F16=1, the five grid formats' gate/up
 in fp16 (HFMA2) on sm_60

Each call's 32 weights are decoded once into subnormal half2 (sign merged by the
unpacking PRMT) and applied to every staged entry with 16 HFMA2, instead of 32
emulated-dp4a VMADs per entry. expdec_bench (P100): gate/up 26-46% faster across
IQ2_XXS/IQ2_XS/IQ2_S/IQ3_XXS/IQ3_S, output rel. RMS ~2.5e-3 vs the int8 path.
Engine (sc117): decode s1/s2/s3 52.97/52.88/52.05 -> 56.19/53.37/54.45, tool
checks 15/15 + 32/32, KL vs warm C2 q1 0.0037 / q2 0.0084. Off by default; not
bitwise the int8 path. expdec_bench gains an f16 choice (relative error check).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
